flowchart LR
    API[public generation API] --> VALIDATE[bounded pre-entropy validation]
    VALIDATE --> ENTROPY[one token_bytes call per basis attempt]
    ENTROPY --> BASIS[uniform canonical hidden basis]
    BASIS --> PAD{generation padding accepted?}
    PAD -->|no, fresh only| ENTROPY
    PAD -->|yes| META[independent random identifier]
    META --> SELECT[SystemRandom.sample or explicit indices]
    SELECT --> DERIVE[bip93 derive_share]
    DERIVE --> OUT[immutable S and ordered shares]
    CLI[thin CLI] --> API
